}
```
CC: 1 + 4 (the four decision points) = 5. Covered → fine.

2. `resolveEarlyConfluenceTarget(params)` — wraps the try/catch of resolveConfig with default target 'jira_field':
```js
function isConfluenceOnlyTarget(params) {
