```
CC: 1 + 2 (&&) + 1 (catch? catch adds CC? catch block adds to complexity in most tools +1) = ~4. Covered.

3. `decideDiagramPlacement(diagram, diagramField, confluenceOnlyTarget)`:
```js
function decideDiagramPlacement(diagram, diagramField, confluenceOnlyTarget) {
   if (diagram && !diagramField && !confluenceOnlyTarget) {
       return { prependAsCodeBlock: true, deferredToConfluence: false };
   }
   if (diagram && !diagramField && confluenceOnlyTarget) {
       return { prependAsCodeBlock: false, deferredToConfluence: true };
