   tracker.moveToStatus(ticketKey, jiraConfig.statuses.READY_FOR_DEVELOPMENT);
```
The TypeError was thrown INSIDE the try, caught, warned. In my refactor, `finalizeTicketState` computes `dependencies.readyForDevelopmentStatus: jiraConfig.statuses.READY_FOR_DEVELOPMENT` — evaluated when building the dependencies object in `action`, OUTSIDE any try/catch → propagates to the outer catch → failure.

